notes[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-29T19:54:12.169Z",codex-coverage-inventory,"Scope: consolidate fixture source reports around the gates emitted include arguments while retaining independent real-c8 pass/fail fixtures. Deduplicate and sort overlapping source roots. Update exact published CLI/SDK pin to 2026.9.29. Depends on parent TSX-gate candidate PR132. Rollout: reviewed source PR only, no publication/deployment. Rollback: revert this change; thresholds/exemptions remain unchanged."
  "2026-09-29T20:01:49.136Z",codex-coverage-inventory,"Red-green evidence: duplicate-root regression failed with four include entries instead of two. Real child c8 initially inherited Node test-worker context and skipped execution; standalone child environment now executes its real assertions. Full release gate then exposed c8 inheriting and cleaning parent NODE_V8_COVERAGE counters, yielding incomplete aggregate coverage. Added a red runner-argument regression and pinned each gate to its repository-owned coverage/tmp. Exact development-version assertion updated alongside the published CLI pin; thresholds unchanged."
  "2026-09-29T20:12:55.278Z",codex-coverage-inventory,"Validated source candidate: npm ci and exact CLI/SDK 2026.9.29 pin pass. Full release:check with real pm-slack and pm-csv selections passes 456/456 tests, zero skips/TODOs, c8 per-file 100 statements/branches/functions/lines across 23 runtime/tooling/template files, 221 selected documented declarations, zero duplication across 43 sources and zero full/production dependency audit findings. PM-linked none/snapshot acceptance passes 11 tests. The default suite still skips two opt-in live-fleet checks. Independent full documentation presence census is 580/1879 declarations and 22/23 module docblocks, tracked by ops-0c8k. Selected docstring gate success is not full documentation coverage. No publication or deployment is authorized by these measurements."
  "2026-09-29T20:22:05.110Z",codex-coverage-inventory,"Review round at dbb0265: Sourcery inline 4137899586 correctly identified collisions for concurrent or nested invocations within one repository. Upvoted and replied with the disposition. Reclaimed this owner for the fix: per-invocation report/counter directories, successful atomic LCOV publication, cleanup and real concurrent process acceptance. Full documentation and broader gate blockers remain."
  "2026-09-29T20:36:19.460Z",codex-coverage-inventory,"CI round at dbb0265 ran its coverage jobs successfully but failed changelog:check: a fresh checkout sees the already published v2026.09.29 tag while the local clone had stale tags. Fetching writable pm-ops refs reproduced the failure locally. Regenerated CHANGELOG.md with pm-changelog, changing only the existing Unreleased heading to 2026.9.29 - 2026-09-29. No release or publication is being created. Independent inventory omission proof fails on index.ts. New broader documentation census: 582/1883 declarations and 22/23 module docblocks, still incomplete."
  "2026-09-29T20:38:33.655Z",codex-coverage-inventory,"Review fixes validated: each gate owns coverage/run-* reports and raw counters, publishes the last successful LCOV atomically, and removes its own temporary artifacts on success or handled failure. Real c8 passes two concurrent same-repository processes and preserves the default parent coverage/tmp sentinel across successful and failing runs. Independent fast-glob inventory covers the actual package; deliberately omitting index.ts fails its assertion. Full release:check passes 456 tests with zero failures/skips/TODOs and all four c8 columns at 100 per-file across 23 files. PM-linked none/snapshot acceptance passes 11 tests. Full/production audits have zero findings, strict health/validate/history pass. Generated changelog is current after writable tag refresh. All four valid inline findings have been upvoted and acknowledged; exact-head review of the fix remains pending."
